Freeze, publish and verify one approved KasugaBus PBW. Never auto-register.
Imports and help are offline and unauthenticated. Publication is a separate,
explicit command and never builds or rewrites its approved artifact.

positional arguments:
  {plan,prepare,publish,verify,begin-registration,record-registration,reconcile-registration,discover-registration}
    plan                Read-only release/version context; no build, bump or
                        publication
    prepare             Freeze an already audited exact PBW and install it
                        physically; no public mutation
    publish             Explicitly publish the frozen artifact; no build or
                        auto-registration
    verify              Read-only bounded verification, preserving partial
                        status
    begin-registration  Approve frozen first listing and journal intent before
                        Dashboard New; never submit/upload
    record-registration
                        Immediately persist assigned ID, verify
                        ownership/UUID, and record optional listing read-back
    reconcile-registration
                        Discover a possibly created owned UUID; never resubmit
                        Dashboard New
    discover-registration
                        Read-only owned UUID/repository/release preflight;
                        optional verified local ID adoption, never creation

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
